      "description": "Dr. Alvin® Color Adapt Tinted Sunscreen 10g.\n\n• UVA UVB protection spf50 PA++++ Broad Spectrum\n• 3 in 1 Mattifying sunscreen protection\n• Suitable for all skin type\n• Non-Comedogenic\n• Non-Greasy\n• Non-Sticky\n• Light feel\n• PABA Free\n• Paraben Free\n\nAchieve natural-looking coverage with soft, smooth after feel combined with smart color-adapt technology to perfectly blend with your skin tone and the advance strengthening power of Hyaluronic Acid for skin barrier protection.\nThis is also helps improve skin elasticity, reduces and blurs the appearance of skin imperfections, and is suitable for all skin types. With the promise of all-day, seamless, oil free, radiant superior sun protection.\n\nHOW TO USE:\nApply an adequate amount onto your fingertips or a make up blender, then blend evenly over a clean face and neck. Can also be use as a primer substitute. For added coverage, layer as needed to conceal dark circles or blemishes. For best protection, apply 15 minutes before sun exposure and reapply after swimming or sweating.",
