          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": 1
        },
        {
          "text": "Achieve natural-looking coverage with soft, smooth after feel combined with smart color-adapt technology to perfectly blend with your skin tone and the advance strengthening power of Hyaluronic Acid for skin barrier protection.",
          "type": 0,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": null
        },
        {
          "text": "This is also helps improve skin elasticity, reduces and blurs the appearance of skin imperfections, and is suitable for all skin types. With the promise of all-day, seamless, oil free, radiant superior sun protection.",
