          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Apply an adequate amount onto your fingertips or a make up blender, then blend evenly over a clean face and neck. Can also be use as a primer substitute. For added coverage, layer as needed to conceal dark circles or blemishes. For best protection, apply 15 minutes before sun exposure and reapply after swimming or sweating.",
